### Prijava kao FULL
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "admin123"}

> {% client.global.set("access", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Prijava kao READONLY
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "citatelj", "password": "citatelj123"}

> {% client.global.set("accessRo", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 1. Sva polja
POST http://localhost:8080/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessRo}}

{"query": "{ tags { id name color notes createdAt } }"}

### 2. ISTI upit, samo name - klijent bira polja
POST http://localhost:8080/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessRo}}

{"query": "{ tags { name } }"}

### 3. Dva upita u JEDNOM zahtjevu (aliasi)
POST http://localhost:8080/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessRo}}

{"query": "{ svi: tags { name } urgentni: tags(term: \"urgent\") { id name } }"}

### 4. Mutacija kao READONLY - ocekivano FORBIDDEN uz HTTP 200
POST http://localhost:8080/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessRo}}

{"query": "mutation { createTag(input: {name: \"ne-smijem\"}) { id } }"}

### 5. Mutacija kao FULL
POST http://localhost:8080/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

{"query": "mutation { createTag(input: {name: \"iz-graphqla\", color: \"green\"}) { id name createdAt } }"}

### 6. Izmjena preko varijabli - promijeni id
POST http://localhost:8080/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

{"query": "mutation($id: ID!, $input: TagInput!) { updateTag(id: $id, input: $input) { id name color } }",
  "variables": {"id": "1", "input": {"name": "izmijenjeno", "color": "red"}}}

### 7. Nepostojeci id - ocekivano NOT_FOUND uz HTTP 200
POST http://localhost:8080/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessRo}}

{"query": "{ tag(id: 999999) { id name } }"}

### 8. Polje kojeg nema u shemi - odbijeno prije izvrsavanja
POST http://localhost:8080/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessRo}}

{"query": "{ tags { nepostojece } }"}